---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout>
  <h1>预测的新 gTLD</h1>

  <p>
    由于 <a
      href="https://www.icann.org/zh/announcements/details/icann-opens-application-window-for-new-generic-top-level-domains-30-04-2026-zh"
      target="_blank"
      class="usa-link usa-link--alt usa-link--external"
      ><u>ICANN 于今年开放了新 gTLD（通用顶级域）的申请</u>
    </a>，10 月 14 日公布这些申请结果，故本人预测可能新出炉的 gTLD
    如下（如非特殊说明，可能都是 <a
      href="https://www.registry.google"
      target="_blank"
      class="usa-link usa-link--alt usa-link--external"
      ><u>Google Registry</u>
    </a> 推出的）：
  </p>

  <table class="usa-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">gTLD 预测</th>
        <th scope="col">结果</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row"><code>.http</code></th>
        <td><i>未知</i></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row"><code>.api</code></th>
        <td><i>未知</i></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row"><code>.html</code></th>
        <td><i>未知</i></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row"><code>.css</code></th>
        <td><i>未知</i></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row"><code>.scss</code></th>
        <td><i>未知</i></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</Layout>
